    "body": "2026-10-21 scheduled-timeout update. Exact current HEAD `8f6720b1f1f3ad55638dae53c527601455eb6826`. Added local Wrangler scheduled-handler integration using an intentionally expired **synthetic** lifecycle genesis fixture and its privately hashed bearer capability. Directly invoked documented local scheduled endpoint twice. First invocation: phase `expired`, version 1; second invocation: still `expired`, version 1 (no duplicate event/transition). Existing tests also PASS for two real participant commits, hidden selections, automatic reveal, same-command replay, Worker restart/reconnect and concurrent commands. Exact-head [Private API PR CI #39603310675](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/39603310675) SUCCESS; [parent SQL #39603310854](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/39603310854) SUCCESS; [forensics #39603310683](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/39603310683) SUCCESS. Remains `LOCAL_WORKER_D1_PASS / PRODUCTION_NOT_DEPLOYED / INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING`; private alpha capability tokens are NOT permanent account auth, production retention/backups/rate limits/cron/identity/Safari not approved. No merge.",
